SECTION 7. COPYLEFT — DERIVATIVE WORKS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

7.1  If you distribute a Covered Work, you must license it to
     all recipients under this license, with all the same
     conditions, without additional restrictions.

7.2  You may not relicense a Covered Work under terms that
     eliminate or weaken the Free Access Preservation
     requirements of Section 3.

7.3  You must make the Complete Corresponding Source Code of
     any Covered Work you distribute available under this
     license, at no charge, by publicly accessible means.

7.4  You may incorporate a Covered Work into a larger work
     containing separate components under different licenses,
     provided:

     (a) the Covered Work portions remain clearly identified
         and licensed under this license;

     (b) the Free Access Preservation requirements of Section 3
         are fully satisfied; and

     (c) the larger work does not prevent recipients from
         exercising their rights under this license with respect
         to the Covered Work portions.

