     (c) a second or subsequent violation of the same provision
         following a prior cure; or

     (d) distributing a Covered Work under terms that affirmatively
         eliminate the Free Access Preservation requirement.

11.4 EFFECT OF TERMINATION. Upon termination, you must immediately
     cease distribution of all Covered Works and cease operation
     of all Pythos Network Services.

     Rights of downstream recipients who received a Covered Work
     from you in compliance with this license before termination
     are not affected by your termination.

11.5 REINSTATEMENT. The copyright holder may reinstate terminated
     rights at their sole discretion, in writing.

